   "like_count": 2,
   "cooked": "<p>In The Hatch Param Proposal Submission Process, is <span class=\"hashtag\">#4</span> - making a forum post necessary? I think the github issue itself might be a better place for dialougue on the proposal.</p>\n<p>The comments sections on GitHub issues are 🪙 🪙 🪙</p>",
   "action": null,
   "source": {
    "source": "commoncrawl",
    "timestamp": "20210928011543",
